title sync-github-issues

component github-sync-webapp as "Issue Sync Admin" web-application
component github-sync-api as "Issue Sync API" service
component sync-db as "Sync Database" database

east user-auth as "Thunder Auth" identity-server
south github as "GitHub" service
south google-chat as "Google Chat" service

north -> github-sync-webapp

github-sync-webapp -> github-sync-api
github-sync-webapp -> user-auth

github-sync-api -> user-auth
github-sync-api -> sync-db
github-sync-api -> github
github-sync-api -> google-chat
